\param aMatchName Name of the directory to be opened. Any path components that are not specified here are taken from the session path. Note that the wildcard characters ? and * can be used. As with all directory paths aName must be terminated with '\\', Please refer to &quot;Structure of paths and filenames&quot; section in the Symbian OS Library.

